    {"type":"text","id":"evidence-floor-text","x":90,"y":1000,"width":1730,"height":130,"text":"RED EVIDENCE FLOOR — SETTLED DIRECTION IS NOT COMPLETION\n1 · same seed/revision/digests + signed coordinates reproduce the canonical projection at declared ticks   2 · seam, negative, first-band, and core-refusal fixtures pass\n3 · baseline + every fluid/material/earthwork delta conserve and survive unload   4 · v3 refuses; new lineage, replay, and migration fail closed\n5 · one-worker and N-worker output are identical; generation/streaming/memory/tick/draw readings are recorded   6 · builder consumes immutable truth, invalidates changed state, and never writes back\n7 · autonomous citizen completes or honestly fails the first night; human observation, accessibility, provenance, and feedback are recorded","originalText":"RED EVIDENCE FLOOR — SETTLED DIRECTION IS NOT COMPLETION\n1 · same seed/revision/digests + signed coordinates reproduce the canonical projection at declared ticks   2 · seam, negative, first-band, and core-refusal fixtures pass\n3 · baseline + every fluid/material/earthwork delta conserve and survive unload   4 · v3 refuses; new lineage, replay, and migration fail closed\n5 · one-worker and N-worker output are identical; generation/streaming/memory/tick/draw readings are recorded   6 · builder consumes immutable truth, invalidates changed state, and never writes back\n7 · autonomous citizen completes or honestly fails the first night; human observation, accessibility, provenance, and feedback are recorded","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#991b1b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":31061,"version":1,"versionNonce":41061,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
